00:05:55.564 --> 00:05:58.226
L, adon, head of the blue whale
ultra heavy armored

00:05:58.233 --> 00:06:00.645
fierce assault annihilation
knight corps

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:02.730
shall teach you the folly
of your actions!

00:06:02.737 --> 00:06:03.737
Big sis!

