00:06:43.904 --> 00:06:47.112
You're not so bad-looking.

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:51.483
I'll overlook your earlier insolence.

00:06:51.703 --> 00:06:54.445
What do you say? Come to chuder.

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:55.278
What?!

00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:57.406
You shall have a thousand...

00:06:57.459 --> 00:06:59.700
I'll give you
a thousand chuder soldiers,

00:06:59.753 --> 00:07:01.414
so you can keep them warm.

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.261
You bastard!

00:07:09.387 --> 00:07:10.422
No?

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.755
Well then, die!

00:07:18.688 --> 00:07:19.688
Huh?

00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:22.691
Guts!

00:07:23.652 --> 00:07:24.812
This isn't like you...

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:35.826
You bastard!

00:07:36.915 --> 00:07:38.780
Anyone will do. Come on.

00:07:39.501 --> 00:07:42.618
I feel like swinging this
as hard as I can.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:46.996
So you countered, eh kid.
Not bad.

00:07:47.008 --> 00:07:48.839
But that was just a lucky break!

00:07:48.927 --> 00:07:50.738
My ultimate spear technique
