00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:10.489
What's the matter?

00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:12.860
This isn't like you.

00:08:13.827 --> 00:08:15.112
If you're not alert...

00:08:22.002 --> 00:08:23.082
H-hey!

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:25.504
Cascal

00:08:28.967 --> 00:08:29.967
hey!

00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:31.461
Snap out of it...

00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:32.678
Cas. .!

00:08:35.306 --> 00:08:36.306
Damn!

00:08:40.186 --> 00:08:41.221
- Big sis!
- Captain!

00:08:41.271 --> 00:08:42.271
Guts!

00:08:48.945 --> 00:08:49.945
Guts!

00:08:50.155 --> 00:08:51.395
Cascal

