of a thousand, correct?

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:05.719
Surely, they can find
their way back on their own.

00:10:06.147 --> 00:10:07.808
I am in total agreement.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.166
Well, I'll take off whatever's soaked.

00:10:41.808 --> 00:10:43.890
She kept on fighting
even though she had a fever.

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:50.138
That's why women are so...

00:10:54.696 --> 00:10:55.401
Huh?

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:57.228
The idiot... she's hurt!

00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:05.407
So that's it.

00:11:08.251 --> 00:11:10.333
Must be rough being a woman.

00:12:02.222 --> 00:12:03.222
Wart!

00:13:02.699 --> 00:13:06.487
If you have something to protect,
take up that sword.

00:14:25.365 --> 00:14:26.365
Hey.

00:14:28.368 --> 00:14:29.368
Where are we”?

00:14:29.911 --> 00:14:31.367
A cave by the river.

00:14:31.746 --> 00:14:33.862
Luckily, falling into
the river saved us.

00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:36.118
Uh. . River?

00:14:36.834 --> 00:14:39.325
Hey! Lie down, stupid!

00:14:40.088 --> 00:14:42.249
Your fever hasn't dropped yet.

00:14:44.133 --> 00:14:45.168
I had no choice.

00:14:45.885 --> 00:14:49.048
You were soaking wet
and freezing to death.

00:14:52.058 --> 00:14:53.138
Don't look at me like that.

00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:54.893
Here...

00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:01.811
What the hell was that for?!

00:15:03.236 --> 00:15:04.236
Hey, stop!

00:15:06.197 --> 00:15:07.482
Hey, you-!

