00:15:21.963 --> 00:15:25.876
If you weren't a woman,
I'd punch you and knock your jaw out!

00:15:26.884 --> 00:15:27.884
A "woman"...

00:15:31.848 --> 00:15:34.715
Damn it, flipping out like that.

00:15:35.351 --> 00:15:38.593
That's why women
don't belong on the battlefield.

00:15:44.944 --> 00:15:45.944
Hey!

00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:51.022
I didn't ask... to be born a woman.

00:15:53.327 --> 00:15:54.327
This is pitiful!

00:15:55.246 --> 00:15:59.159
You're the only one
I didn't want to be saved by!

00:16:00.418 --> 00:16:01.703
You're the only one...

00:16:03.713 --> 00:16:04.713
You're still not well.

00:16:06.757 --> 00:16:09.169
You really hate me, don't you...
Damn it?

00:16:16.225 --> 00:16:17.431
Do you remember?

00:16:18.853 --> 00:16:22.846
What Griffith said to you that day,
on the hill?

00:16:24.525 --> 00:16:26.516
I want you, gufs.

00:16:27.778 --> 00:16:28.778
Yeah.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:32.363
Griffith has never said
that to anyone else.

00:16:33.075 --> 00:16:34.690
Not before, and not since.

00:16:36.245 --> 00:16:37.485
Why is that?!

00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:39.699
Why did it have to be you?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.500
Why?

00:16:43.794 --> 00:16:45.455
I wanted to be...

00:16:46.422 --> 00:16:48.037
His sword.

00:16:55.765 --> 00:16:56.765
I see...

00:16:59.101 --> 00:17:01.057
So that's your dream.

00:17:02.313 --> 00:17:04.599
Hey, are you sure they're around here?

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.521
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:17:07.276 --> 00:17:09.062
You sure they're not dead?

00:17:09.529 --> 00:17:11.440
They fell off that cliff, after all.

00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:15.440
Sir adon said he'd pay
the bounty even for their corpses.

00:17:16.619 --> 00:17:18.530
Let's look a little further downstream.

00:17:19.247 --> 00:17:20.737
There's no time to waste.

00:17:40.893 --> 00:17:42.599
What about you?

00:17:43.729 --> 00:17:45.094
Why do you...

00:17:45.356 --> 00:17:46.687
Fight?

00:17:47.233 --> 00:17:49.724
Don't talk. You need to
save your strength.

00:18:14.218 --> 00:18:16.709
I found you brats!

00:18:16.971 --> 00:18:20.304
Hey! You're looking lively, old man!

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:21.600
It's him!

00:18:21.892 --> 00:18:23.257
Impudence!

00:18:23.644 --> 00:18:25.976
