00:18:32.278 --> 00:18:34.985
And show you what hell
on earth is all about.

00:18:35.281 --> 00:18:38.569
I'll leave the woman here for
the mercenary soldiers to feast on!

00:18:42.538 --> 00:18:44.529
I don't think that's a good idea.

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.156
She's pretty vicious.
She'll bite it off!

00:18:49.587 --> 00:18:51.043
Such insolence!

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:52.916
Get them!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.390
I'll get up front.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.289
Make a run for it straight
into the forest!

00:19:07.313 --> 00:19:08.313
Huh?

00:19:13.986 --> 00:19:15.897
Now! Move it!

00:19:17.698 --> 00:19:20.690
Don't be ridiculous!
I'm not going to run off alone!

00:19:20.785 --> 00:19:22.025
Don't get me wrong!

00:19:23.037 --> 00:19:25.574
The sick will only get in my way!

00:19:26.916 --> 00:19:29.157
Archers! Aim for the woman!

00:19:32.713 --> 00:19:34.374
Fire!

00:19:39.512 --> 00:19:40.512
Guts!

00:19:44.934 --> 00:19:46.049
What a fool.

00:19:46.268 --> 00:19:50.136
Sacrificing himself not once,
but twice for a woman.

00:19:50.648 --> 00:19:52.354
Why... why?!

00:19:55.695 --> 00:19:58.357
A sword returns to its sheath.

00:19:58.614 --> 00:19:59.614
Huh?

00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:02.656
Go home to your sword master.

00:20:03.411 --> 00:20:04.742
Go to Griffith.

00:20:05.538 --> 00:20:08.530
I'll think about an answer
to your question earlier.

00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:15.461
Do not fear!
There are only two of them!

00:20:15.589 --> 00:20:18.331
Surround them and attack at once!

00:20:27.685 --> 00:20:28.390
Go!

00:20:28.477 --> 00:20:30.183
Don't just stand there! Go!

00:20:36.235 --> 00:20:38.226
I swear I'll return with the others.

00:20:38.571 --> 00:20:39.606
Until then...

00:20:40.114 --> 00:20:41.114
Don't die!

00:20:45.661 --> 00:20:46.992
Don't let the woman get away!

00:20:47.037 --> 00:20:48.322
Kill her!

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:52.281
You can go chase after girls...

00:20:52.918 --> 00:20:54.124
After you finish your job.

00:21:00.134 --> 00:21:01.134
Don't die!

00:21:16.817 --> 00:21:18.557
His left hand is useless!

00:21:18.611 --> 00:21:22.445
He won't be able swing that
ridiculously big sword anymore!

00:21:26.076 --> 00:21:28.032
This is getting interesting...

00:21:55.231 --> 00:21:57.222
You sure caused us
a lot of trouble, girl.

00:22:00.653 --> 00:22:01.653
Why you-!

00:22:03.989 --> 00:22:05.069
Just give up.

00:22:29.223 --> 00:22:31.635
Why am I so... weak?!

00:22:32.268 --> 00:22:34.133
Don't even think about
biting your tongue.

00:22:34.395 --> 00:22:36.556
I want you to be alive for this.

00:22:43.279 --> 00:22:45.941
Go back to your sword master.

00:22:50.119 --> 00:22:51.450
I won't bite my tongue.

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:55.950
I won't let you have your way
with me either!

00:23:00.462 --> 00:23:01.462
Why you-!

00:23:02.381 --> 00:23:03.666
You bitch!

00:23:16.395 --> 00:23:17.885
Are you all right, casca?

00:23:24.778 --> 00:23:25.778
Hurry!

00:23:26.196 --> 00:23:30.860
Guts stayed back with the enemy...
So I could escape!

00:23:33.037 --> 00:23:34.698
Send every man available!

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:45.166
In a stupid place like this...

00:23:47.092 --> 00:23:48.548
Risking my lite...

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:51.756
So cheaply?

00:23:56.268 --> 00:24:02.480
A dream he must realize for himself,
and himself alone.

00:24:09.031 --> 00:24:12.523
To simply live a life
because one was born info it...

00:24:14.745 --> 00:24:18.078
I can't accept that.

00:24:22.002 --> 00:24:23.833
A mend fo me...

00:24:24.338 --> 00:24:28.206
Ls... an equal.

00:24:52.908 --> 00:24:56.366
You call yourselves men of chuder?!

00:24:59.498 --> 00:25:00.829
There's no time fo think...

00:25:03.544 --> 00:25:05.626
Right now, all there is...
Is how fo cut..

00:25:06.505 --> 00:25:07.790
How fo kill...

00:25:09.174 --> 00:25:10.254
That's all there js.

00:25:33.323 --> 00:25:34.363
I hope we make it in time!

00:25:36.952 --> 00:25:37.952
Over here!

00:25:48.213 --> 00:25:49.213
Amazing...

00:25:51.717 --> 00:25:53.924
Did the captain do all this?

00:25:54.219 --> 00:25:56.881
No way. There must be
close to a hundred...

00:25:58.766 --> 00:26:00.506
Guts, are you here?

00:26:06.732 --> 00:26:08.438
Answer me, guts!

00:26:15.365 --> 00:26:16.365
Guts!

00:26:18.827 --> 00:26:19.827
Captain!

00:26:20.454 --> 00:26:21.489
Captain guts!

00:26:29.713 --> 00:26:30.713
Hey...

00:26:31.006 --> 00:26:32.006
This doesn't look good...

00:26:32.966 --> 00:26:34.581
Guts! Hey!

00:26:35.385 --> 00:26:36.625
I told you not to die!

00:26:37.346 --> 00:26:40.053
Are you breaking
your promise to me?!

00:26:47.356 --> 00:26:48.095
Guts. . I

00:26:48.107 --> 00:26:49.392
shut up!

00:26:50.526 --> 00:26:52.016
Don't shake me.

00:26:53.946 --> 00:26:55.937
It makes my wounds hurt.

00:26:58.700 --> 00:26:59.700
Guts...

00:27:10.337 --> 00:27:11.337
Amazing!

00:27:11.713 --> 00:27:13.419
Man, the captain's a monster.

00:27:13.465 --> 00:27:15.585
These guys probably didn't think
that they could lose.

00:27:15.843 --> 00:27:17.424
Ouch! Ouch!

00:27:18.637 --> 00:27:22.380
The band of the hawk has
the "guts" to slay a hundred men!

00:27:24.560 --> 00:27:26.846
Captain guts who slew
a hundred men!

00:27:26.895 --> 00:27:28.681
- Hurrah!
- Hurrah!

00:27:36.989 --> 00:27:37.989
Release!

00:28:18.405 --> 00:28:20.145
I can't believe this.

00:28:21.033 --> 00:28:22.739
Not a single man can get close.

00:28:23.535 --> 00:28:25.275
No wonder doldrey is so feared.

00:28:40.469 --> 00:28:44.212
It's the holy purple rhino knights!
Boscogn is coming!

00:28:51.521 --> 00:28:54.012
Their defense is impregnable and
any enemy is easily repelled.

00:28:54.483 --> 00:28:56.348
Then the exhausted forces
come under assault

00:28:56.401 --> 00:28:59.268
by the holy purple rhino knights,
reputedly chuder's strongest.

00:28:59.947 --> 00:29:03.439
As a result of this audacious tactic,
the loss to our army,

00:29:03.450 --> 00:29:07.284
including our elite white tiger knights,
has climbed to 30%.

00:29:07.704 --> 00:29:08.944
Any more losses...

00:29:09.831 --> 00:29:11.037
We know that already!

00:29:11.583 --> 00:29:14.620
Doldrey was long
a stronghold of midland.

00:29:14.920 --> 00:29:16.706
Of course, it cannot
be penetrated easily.

00:29:17.965 --> 00:29:22.083
There is internal conflict in chuder
over the next succession to the throne.

00:29:22.344 --> 00:29:25.802
They do not have the reserves
to focus on a battle here...

00:29:26.098 --> 00:29:27.804
If this becomes
a long, drawn-out battle...

00:29:27.849 --> 00:29:29.134
Enough discussion.

00:29:29.518 --> 00:29:31.975
Doldrey is chuder's last foothold.

00:29:32.312 --> 00:29:35.896
We must defeat chuder and
end this hundred years' war now...

00:29:35.941 --> 00:29:37.647
This is the time to do it!

00:29:38.235 --> 00:29:41.693
He is right.
This is our one-in-a-thousand chance.

00:29:41.947 --> 00:29:43.027
But...

00:29:47.869 --> 00:29:51.202
Chuder is suffering as well.

00:29:51.665 --> 00:29:54.327
My generals, how do you feel
about total warfare?

00:29:54.626 --> 00:29:56.241
I am opposed.

00:29:56.586 --> 00:30:00.670
Morale is low and
men are deserting like flies.

00:30:00.757 --> 00:30:04.170
With the white tiger knights annihilated...

00:30:04.845 --> 00:30:08.508
Also, we still have remnant enemy
forces to deal with in our territories.

00:30:08.807 --> 00:30:11.719
If the enemy should attack
from the rear,

00:30:11.768 --> 00:30:14.510
the situation will be irreparable.

00:30:14.646 --> 00:30:16.762
If this military expedition continues,

00:30:16.982 --> 00:30:19.769
there will be need for
additional defense funds.

00:30:20.152 --> 00:30:22.689
More taxation will burden
the citizens...

00:30:22.696 --> 00:30:24.482
- And lead to unrest...
- Even you must consider this situation...

00:30:24.489 --> 00:30:26.525
A dilemma, sir hawk.

00:30:26.825 --> 00:30:28.065
If I were so ordered...

00:30:28.160 --> 00:30:30.321
Well, that's to be expected.

00:30:30.579 --> 00:30:33.446
Even for a genius of warfare
such as yourself...

00:30:33.498 --> 00:30:34.498
What?

00:30:41.214 --> 00:30:42.829
If his majesty so ordered me...

00:30:46.386 --> 00:30:47.786
There is no need for a large force.

00:30:48.513 --> 00:30:50.720
The band of the hawk
will take this on.

00:30:51.183 --> 00:30:52.423
- What did you-7?!
- What?!

00:30:52.476 --> 00:30:53.215
Ridiculous!

00:30:53.226 --> 00:30:56.093
The band of the hawk to
recapture doldrey by themselves?!

00:30:56.855 --> 00:30:59.437
Even the white tiger knights
were annihilated...

00:30:59.775 --> 00:31:01.060
Are you in your right mind?!

00:31:01.360 --> 00:31:03.271
We are talking about
a mere 5,000 on horseback

00:31:03.320 --> 00:31:05.481
against an army 30,000 strong!

00:31:05.655 --> 00:31:08.362
Ridiculous! This is the foolish talk
of a novice!

00:31:08.867 --> 00:31:11.574
Over these one hundred years,
countless distinguished generals

00:31:11.578 --> 00:31:13.614
have attempted and failed
to conquer doldrey.

00:31:13.872 --> 00:31:16.329
The band of the hawk cannot manage
such a feat alone!

00:31:18.877 --> 00:31:22.961
Sir Griffith, was that Sincere?

00:31:37.354 --> 00:31:41.097
I command the band of the hawk
to capture doldrey!

00:31:50.826 --> 00:31:51.826
The band of the hawk?!

00:31:52.077 --> 00:31:55.365
Yes. Roughly 5,000 of them
are headed this way.

00:31:55.997 --> 00:31:58.579
They expect to take doldrey
with a mere 5,000?

00:31:58.959 --> 00:32:00.119
What do they...?

00:32:00.252 --> 00:32:02.288
General boscogn...

00:32:02.504 --> 00:32:03.504
Yes?

00:32:03.755 --> 00:32:07.794
Griffith the white hawk must
not be killed.

00:32:08.385 --> 00:32:09.385
Huh?

00:32:09.469 --> 00:32:12.757
Bring the hawk here alive.

00:32:13.682 --> 00:32:14.682
Understand?

00:32:15.100 --> 00:32:16.100
But...

00:32:16.226 --> 00:32:18.512
As long as he is alive,
the band of the hawk...

00:32:18.562 --> 00:32:21.429
Rather, the momentum of
midland cannot be stopped.

00:32:21.440 --> 00:32:23.180
General boscogn!

00:32:25.610 --> 00:32:26.770
Understood?

00:32:27.612 --> 00:32:28.612
Yes, sir.

00:32:42.544 --> 00:32:45.502
Damn it... how are we supposed
to attack?

00:32:46.506 --> 00:32:48.713
The back of it is a cliff...

00:32:49.217 --> 00:32:51.879
They've got 20 of
the latest catapults.

00:32:52.429 --> 00:32:53.293
On top of that,

00:32:53.305 --> 00:32:55.842
we'll be rained upon with arrows,
hot oil and rocks.

00:32:56.516 --> 00:32:59.349
We have no choice
but to attack from the front.

00:33:00.020 --> 00:33:03.308
And there's the holy purple
rhino knights too, right?

00:33:04.316 --> 00:33:06.147
We can win, can't we?

00:33:09.029 --> 00:33:10.029
Guts?

00:33:10.322 --> 00:33:11.322
Huh?

00:33:11.907 --> 00:33:14.944
The fortress is a little big, so what?

00:33:18.413 --> 00:33:21.871
Just do what Griffith says
and it will be ours.

00:33:22.417 --> 00:33:23.417
Right?

00:33:34.804 --> 00:33:36.089
What are they planning?

00:33:36.556 --> 00:33:38.326
Setting up formation with
the river behind them?

00:33:38.350 --> 00:33:40.270
Don't they know anything
about military strategy?

00:33:40.519 --> 00:33:43.761
Whatever it is,
considering the size of their force,

00:33:43.813 --> 00:33:45.929
it's just a desperate tactic.

00:33:46.149 --> 00:33:48.356
We will take them straight on,
nothing else.

00:33:48.527 --> 00:33:49.527
Yes, sir!

00:33:57.035 --> 00:33:58.070
Griffith...

00:33:59.788 --> 00:34:01.779
I've been waiting for you.

00:34:03.458 --> 00:34:05.744
General adon,
I'm glad to see you well.

00:34:13.885 --> 00:34:16.217
Anything happen in my absence?

00:34:18.473 --> 00:34:19.473
Are you ready?

00:34:30.443 --> 00:34:32.684
Vanguard... onward!

00:34:34.698 --> 00:34:36.108
Draw your swords!

00:34:45.083 --> 00:34:46.914
Vanguard, attack!

00:35:00.890 --> 00:35:01.970
The enemy is on the move!

00:35:02.142 --> 00:35:04.007
Count Griffith himself leads
the vanguard.

00:35:04.060 --> 00:35:05.204
The rest number roughly 2000.

00:35:05.228 --> 00:35:08.265
He's divided his already
small army into two?

00:35:08.607 --> 00:35:10.973
With the general himself
at the fore?

00:35:12.110 --> 00:35:13.975
Interesting, let us take him on.

00:35:14.779 --> 00:35:18.192
Call up the advance guard!
Destroy the enemy's first wave!

00:36:01.034 --> 00:36:02.365
Follow the captain!

00:36:03.703 --> 00:36:05.193
No way! We can't stop them!

00:36:05.413 --> 00:36:07.369
Our holy purple rhino knights
are being pushed back!

00:36:07.374 --> 00:36:08.784
The enemy is too fast!

00:36:11.336 --> 00:36:12.496
G-general!

00:36:12.837 --> 00:36:14.373
The enemy is approaching.

00:36:14.673 --> 00:36:15.673
Do not panic!

00:36:16.508 --> 00:36:18.544
He's taking advantage of
the mobility of a light cavalry

00:36:18.551 --> 00:36:20.667
to force through our line.

00:36:22.347 --> 00:36:24.429
Put our heavy cavalry directly
before the enemy.

00:36:24.474 --> 00:36:26.510
And archers, commence attack
from both flanks!

00:36:27.394 --> 00:36:29.225
What will you do now, hawk?

00:36:38.613 --> 00:36:40.228
The enemy is calm!

00:36:46.871 --> 00:36:48.611
They're trying to make us scatter!

00:36:49.124 --> 00:36:52.082
Damn boscogn! What is he doing?

00:36:52.210 --> 00:36:54.792
Griffith could very well be killed.

00:37:08.518 --> 00:37:09.928
Vanguard! Fall back!

00:37:10.353 --> 00:37:12.093
Return to the main force!

00:37:13.398 --> 00:37:15.263
Go straight through them!

00:37:18.570 --> 00:37:19.570
W-what?

00:37:19.821 --> 00:37:20.981
They're coming back!

00:37:25.535 --> 00:37:27.571
The enemy is retreating.

00:37:28.913 --> 00:37:29.913
I can't figure it out.

00:37:30.415 --> 00:37:33.782
He should have anticipated
this result from the very start.

00:37:34.252 --> 00:37:36.413
This is the band of the hawk
who knows only victory.

00:37:36.421 --> 00:37:37.706
The white hawk, no less.

00:37:38.089 --> 00:37:42.253
What are you doing,
general boscogn...?

00:37:42.510 --> 00:37:43.510
Governor general!

00:37:44.220 --> 00:37:45.960
The enemy is retreating.

00:37:46.765 --> 00:37:49.256
Will you let victory slip out
of our hands?

00:37:49.684 --> 00:37:51.515
No... well...

00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:55.345
Listen, everyone!

00:37:55.648 --> 00:37:58.014
A reward of your asking
awaits anyone

00:37:58.067 --> 00:38:00.479
who captures the enemy general,
the white hawk!

00:38:00.528 --> 00:38:04.066
However, he must be taken unharmed!

00:38:04.282 --> 00:38:05.282
Understood?

00:38:07.494 --> 00:38:10.861
Governor general! It is unwise to
make such a lofty promise to soldiers.

00:38:10.914 --> 00:38:12.154
They will be uncontroll-

00:38:12.207 --> 00:38:13.913
general boscogn...

00:38:14.125 --> 00:38:15.661
Thank you for your service

00:38:16.961 --> 00:38:19.668
I, gennon, will be taking command.

00:38:19.756 --> 00:38:21.667
Your holy purple rhino knights
will henceforth

00:38:21.716 --> 00:38:23.581
join the blue whale, black wolf,

00:38:23.635 --> 00:38:27.093
and my scorpion serpent assault
knights in pursuing the enemy,

00:38:27.138 --> 00:38:30.301
and to swiftly capture Griffith.

00:38:30.350 --> 00:38:32.306
But what about defending the fortress?!

00:38:34.604 --> 00:38:35.684
What is the matter?

00:38:36.481 --> 00:38:39.097
Did you not hear my order,
general boscogn?

00:38:42.070 --> 00:38:43.185
General...

00:38:43.363 --> 00:38:44.523
We have no choice.

00:38:45.490 --> 00:38:47.776
However, kill the hawks without fail.

00:38:48.493 --> 00:38:51.360
We cannot allow them to
have free rein any longer.

00:38:51.830 --> 00:38:52.830
Yes, sir!

00:38:54.123 --> 00:38:56.580
We will begin pursuit of the enemy!

00:39:32.287 --> 00:39:37.407
Are we supposed to...
Take on all of them?

00:39:52.181 --> 00:39:53.591
Take formation!

00:39:55.018 --> 00:39:57.634
The river is behind us.
We have no escape route!

00:39:58.354 --> 00:39:59.594
Lay down your lives...

00:40:00.023 --> 00:40:02.184
There's no other chance
for survival!

00:40:03.318 --> 00:40:05.775
If we do survive,
we will stand victorious!

00:40:41.481 --> 00:40:42.481
Damn it!

00:41:23.147 --> 00:41:24.603
The enemy force is small.

00:41:26.818 --> 00:41:27.853
Mow them down

00:41:27.860 --> 00:41:29.860
before they have a chance to
pull any cheap tricks!

00:41:39.455 --> 00:41:41.036
Damn it! It's no good!

00:41:42.750 --> 00:41:46.038
I'd rather die fighting than
drown in some river!

00:41:48.089 --> 00:41:50.876
Little rickert's lost it!

00:42:03.855 --> 00:42:04.855
You are?

00:42:05.148 --> 00:42:08.231
Guts, the captain of the raiders,
from the band of the hawk.

00:42:09.235 --> 00:42:12.819
I can't see a thing.
What's going on out there?

00:42:12.864 --> 00:42:14.479
Don't even bother worrying.

00:42:14.657 --> 00:42:16.568
The outcome is obvious.

00:42:17.160 --> 00:42:20.744
I'm more interested in when
we'll get some booze around here.

00:42:21.205 --> 00:42:24.789
The one who snares the enemy general
will get any reward he asks for...

00:42:24.917 --> 00:42:27.329
And I get stuck with this stupid duty.

00:42:29.255 --> 00:42:30.540
What? What's the matter?

00:42:32.717 --> 00:42:33.502
Th-that's...

00:42:33.551 --> 00:42:36.258
That's a different enemy force!

00:42:55.156 --> 00:42:57.021
Hey, something's strange...

00:42:58.367 --> 00:43:00.608
Sir adon, we have intruders
in the castle!

00:43:04.123 --> 00:43:05.123
Hurry!

00:43:07.919 --> 00:43:10.877
All right! Hurry and close the gates!

00:43:11.089 --> 00:43:13.045
Do not allow messengers to leave!

00:43:13.299 --> 00:43:16.006
The barbier and benoit troops
will do as planned

00:43:16.052 --> 00:43:17.542
and subdue all remaining
enemy troops!

00:43:17.595 --> 00:43:19.131
Every second counts!

00:43:20.348 --> 00:43:22.384
Griffith was right about everything.

00:43:22.433 --> 00:43:23.473
You got to hand it to him.

00:43:25.436 --> 00:43:26.516
Big sis!

00:43:30.775 --> 00:43:32.811
Such a foolish woman.

00:43:32.944 --> 00:43:34.024
You're making a big mistake

00:43:34.070 --> 00:43:35.981
if you think things
will go your way so easily.

00:43:35.988 --> 00:43:38.024
I'll show you no mercy this time!

00:43:38.199 --> 00:43:39.154
Commander casca!

00:43:39.200 --> 00:43:40.315
Don't interfere!

00:43:42.870 --> 00:43:45.577
I'll deal with him myself!

00:43:47.291 --> 00:43:49.657
You fool!

00:43:54.173 --> 00:43:55.458
W-wow...

00:44:10.481 --> 00:44:11.596
He's strong...

00:44:12.483 --> 00:44:15.190
What is taking boscogn so long?

00:44:18.156 --> 00:44:19.896
Don't let up. Push them back.

00:44:21.159 --> 00:44:22.159
Oh...!

00:44:39.594 --> 00:44:41.084
H-how?

00:44:41.345 --> 00:44:44.553
You're fighting like
a different person!

00:44:44.849 --> 00:44:49.218
As long as I'm physically sound,
I'd never lose to a bastard like you!

00:44:51.314 --> 00:44:53.179
Big sis really is incredible!

00:44:53.524 --> 00:44:54.644
I've got this under control.

00:44:54.984 --> 00:44:56.565
Hurry with the preparations!

00:44:56.694 --> 00:44:57.694
Right! _ right!

00:45:06.621 --> 00:45:07.621
Guts!

00:45:32.730 --> 00:45:34.766
Well then, boscogn...

00:45:36.692 --> 00:45:39.604
What happened to the fighting spirit
you had earlier?

00:45:39.862 --> 00:45:45.152
Hey, your arm is dropping!
Is your sword too heavy for you?

00:45:46.577 --> 00:45:48.613
You can't even muster a retort.

00:45:52.083 --> 00:45:54.074
Hey, it's the captain of the raiders!

00:45:54.752 --> 00:45:56.288
Just kidding!

00:46:04.595 --> 00:46:05.595
How was that?

00:46:05.805 --> 00:46:10.048
The coborlwitz family distraction
technique, honed over 1000 years.

00:46:10.142 --> 00:46:12.303
You fell right for it!

00:46:12.311 --> 00:46:13.471
- Big sis!
- Commander casca!

00:46:13.521 --> 00:46:14.931
Stay out of this!

00:46:15.648 --> 00:46:17.013
Such pride!

00:46:17.441 --> 00:46:19.352
I wonder if you'll still be proud

00:46:19.402 --> 00:46:22.610
when I amuse myself with you
before your men.

00:46:22.863 --> 00:46:26.151
I'm going to get a good taste
of your soft skin.

00:46:26.450 --> 00:46:30.238
I shall teach you what true joy
is to a woman.

00:46:30.705 --> 00:46:31.705
Wha-"?!

00:46:40.548 --> 00:46:41.958
Get a good taste of this.

00:46:50.850 --> 00:46:52.056
Way to go, commander casca!

00:46:52.101 --> 00:46:53.341
You had us mesmerized!

00:46:55.604 --> 00:46:57.185
We lost precious time. Let's hurry!

00:47:11.370 --> 00:47:13.110
Captain!

00:47:13.664 --> 00:47:14.949
We'll assist!

00:47:16.375 --> 00:47:17.535
This side first!

00:47:17.960 --> 00:47:18.870
Stop!

00:47:18.919 --> 00:47:20.204
He's too much for you guys!

00:47:24.675 --> 00:47:26.540
Nuisances!

00:47:42.193 --> 00:47:45.902
It's over, captain of the raiders!

00:48:16.852 --> 00:48:18.843
- General boscogn was...!
- No way!

00:48:18.896 --> 00:48:20.261
The strongest knight in chuder!

00:48:20.940 --> 00:48:23.147
Damn, he did it!

00:48:24.693 --> 00:48:26.103
B-boscogn!

00:48:27.571 --> 00:48:31.280
Do not panic.
He is completely outnumbered!

00:48:31.534 --> 00:48:33.195
Get into formation!

00:48:51.554 --> 00:48:53.590
What is... that banner?!

00:48:54.014 --> 00:48:56.756
Impossible!
The fortress couldn't have...

00:48:56.934 --> 00:48:58.265
No, that can't be!

00:48:58.561 --> 00:49:00.597
Idiots, haven't you figured it out yet?

00:49:02.606 --> 00:49:05.769
Your general is dead.
Your fortress has fallen.

00:49:06.318 --> 00:49:07.933
Isn't it obvious what that spells?

00:49:08.571 --> 00:49:10.687
You lost.

00:49:11.365 --> 00:49:12.365
Cry out!

00:49:12.992 --> 00:49:14.698
Cry out for victory!

00:49:15.119 --> 00:49:16.359
I was waiting for that!

00:49:41.228 --> 00:49:43.435
Show no mercy if
the enemy offers opposition!

00:49:48.486 --> 00:49:51.978
Fools! Who ordered you to retreat?!

00:49:52.239 --> 00:49:54.070
I am your supreme commander!

00:49:54.658 --> 00:49:56.068
Stop, I say!

00:49:56.827 --> 00:49:58.738
Follow my orders!

00:50:00.080 --> 00:50:03.789
Hey, you! Come back! Come back!

00:50:29.485 --> 00:50:31.601
It's been a long time,
lord gennon.

00:50:36.116 --> 00:50:37.116
Oh!

00:50:37.243 --> 00:50:41.577
Griffith! How I have waited
for this moment.

00:50:42.331 --> 00:50:44.788
Come... let me have
a closer look at your face.

00:50:46.544 --> 00:50:47.544
Those eyes...

00:50:47.753 --> 00:50:50.916
That gaze has not changed
since that time.

00:50:54.760 --> 00:50:57.672
What's the matter?
Why are you so quiet?

00:50:58.264 --> 00:50:59.879
We may have parted foes,

00:50:59.974 --> 00:51:02.511
but I never forgot about you
for a second.

00:51:02.726 --> 00:51:05.263
I always looked for your shadow...

00:51:05.854 --> 00:51:07.515
Right? Griffi...

00:51:09.066 --> 00:51:10.066
Griffith!

00:51:12.945 --> 00:51:14.981
Why do you look at me like that?

00:51:16.073 --> 00:51:19.065
Don't tell me you resent me?

00:51:22.496 --> 00:51:24.782
I do not resent you, excellency.

00:51:25.499 --> 00:51:26.955
In fact, just the opposite.

00:51:27.668 --> 00:51:32.332
By using you, I was able to provide
for hundreds of my subordinates.

00:51:33.591 --> 00:51:35.911
Without having to send them
onto a treacherous battlefield.

00:51:36.927 --> 00:51:39.543
We all owe you our lives.

00:51:40.806 --> 00:51:42.637
Griffith, you...!

00:51:42.850 --> 00:51:47.435
I can only do one thing for
my subordinates who share my dream...

00:51:48.105 --> 00:51:50.096
That is to continue winning.

00:51:50.649 --> 00:51:52.480
That's why I do not choose the method.

00:51:53.110 --> 00:51:58.730
You were like a stone lying
by the side of the path I walk.

00:52:00.492 --> 00:52:03.859
You bastard!

00:54:04.324 --> 00:54:05.814
Three cheers for
the band of the hawk!

00:54:05.909 --> 00:54:07.774
The savior of midland!

00:54:07.786 --> 00:54:10.152
Thank you!
We are grateful for your efforts!

00:54:10.622 --> 00:54:11.907
Lord Griffith!

00:54:12.082 --> 00:54:13.618
Lord Griffith!

00:54:13.751 --> 00:54:15.537
- Lord Griffith!
- How handsome!

00:54:15.669 --> 00:54:17.876
Will you look at this?!

00:54:18.255 --> 00:54:20.462
I didn't know so many people
lived in windham.

00:54:25.387 --> 00:54:26.387
Whoa!

00:54:29.600 --> 00:54:31.807
No fair, corkus!

00:54:31.810 --> 00:54:33.175
One at a time. One at a time!

00:54:33.228 --> 00:54:34.809
Me too!

00:54:36.857 --> 00:54:39.519
Miss casca! Look this way!

00:54:44.072 --> 00:54:45.278
On! It's the raiders!

00:54:45.282 --> 00:54:46.488
I see captain guts too!

00:54:46.575 --> 00:54:48.281
He's the strongest warrior
in the hawks!

00:54:56.668 --> 00:54:59.034
Wow... this is amazing!

00:54:59.505 --> 00:55:02.338
How about it, captain?
Wave to the crowd.

00:55:03.383 --> 00:55:05.795
You're the hero of this battle,
after all.

00:55:08.680 --> 00:55:09.680
Captain?

00:55:09.807 --> 00:55:10.512
Hmm?

00:55:10.766 --> 00:55:13.382
What's the matter?
You've been in a daze.

00:55:13.811 --> 00:55:15.676
And you've been so quiet, lately.

00:55:16.271 --> 00:55:17.511
No, it's nothing.

00:55:18.357 --> 00:55:21.520
Nobody would've thought of
something like this three years ago.

00:55:22.194 --> 00:55:23.650
I'll say.

00:55:25.572 --> 00:55:28.234
I will get my own kingdom...

00:55:38.669 --> 00:55:40.034
Nobody but him.

00:55:50.430 --> 00:55:51.430
Thank you.

00:56:04.236 --> 00:56:05.726
This is amazing!

00:56:06.238 --> 00:56:08.069
Oh my, look.

00:56:08.115 --> 00:56:10.071
Aren't they from the band of the hawk?

00:56:10.117 --> 00:56:12.153
Oh, the guardians of midland!

00:56:12.494 --> 00:56:14.655
We have to look sharp,
or they'll make fun of us.

00:56:15.205 --> 00:56:17.537
Welcome home, lord Griffith.

00:56:18.667 --> 00:56:20.453
We were very worried about you.

00:56:20.586 --> 00:56:22.918
I prayed for you every day.

00:56:23.213 --> 00:56:25.704
Do you have a dance partner?

00:56:25.924 --> 00:56:29.087
I'd love to hear the exploits of
the band of the hawk.

00:56:29.344 --> 00:56:33.428
Won't you get bored listening
to barbaric tales of battle?

00:56:34.224 --> 00:56:35.805
Not at all!

00:56:35.893 --> 00:56:37.724
They're very stimulating.

00:56:37.728 --> 00:56:39.434
He's a natural!

00:56:39.771 --> 00:56:40.771
Jeez!

00:56:41.440 --> 00:56:44.307
He could at least send one our way!

00:56:44.526 --> 00:56:46.858
You're the captains of
the band of the hawk, aren't you?

00:56:47.237 --> 00:56:47.942
Huh?

00:56:48.071 --> 00:56:50.778
I'd love to hear
your heroic tales of battle.

00:56:50.991 --> 00:56:52.902
You must be so strong.

00:56:53.368 --> 00:56:55.529
Oh well, yes...

00:56:55.579 --> 00:56:57.786
Oh, do regale us.

00:56:57.915 --> 00:57:01.499
Oh, I couldn't finish in a single night...
Do you have the time?

00:57:01.543 --> 00:57:03.079
All the time in the world.

00:57:03.211 --> 00:57:05.042
You're the captain of the raiders?

00:57:05.631 --> 00:57:08.122
He slew one hundred of
the enemy by himself.

00:57:08.216 --> 00:57:09.296
Really?

00:57:09.593 --> 00:57:13.085
He's the one who brought down
general boscogn too.

00:57:13.430 --> 00:57:16.638
Oh my... who's stronger?
You or lord Griffith?

00:57:17.267 --> 00:57:20.976
- Amazing muscles!
- Oh, so hard!

00:57:21.021 --> 00:57:22.386
I could fall in love!

00:57:22.940 --> 00:57:24.726
Oh, how cute...

00:57:25.067 --> 00:57:26.648
Do you belong to
the band of the hawk too?

00:57:26.652 --> 00:57:28.768
Y-yes, I do.

00:57:28.820 --> 00:57:31.562
Then, who should attack but...

00:57:31.615 --> 00:57:33.901
The knights led by general boscogn!

00:57:33.951 --> 00:57:37.409
- Give me a break...
- None other than...

00:57:37.454 --> 00:57:40.366
- Hey! No fair, guts!
- The holy purple rhino...

00:57:44.628 --> 00:57:46.710
You've got to be kidding...

00:57:47.798 --> 00:57:49.163
No, I...

00:57:49.466 --> 00:57:50.797
Did someone else already ask?

00:57:50.968 --> 00:57:52.424
Y-yes...

00:57:52.803 --> 00:57:56.637
No man could possibly ignore
a woman like you.

00:57:57.099 --> 00:57:58.635
How about after him then?

00:57:58.892 --> 00:58:01.258
No, no... I am after him.

00:58:01.645 --> 00:58:02.645
But...

00:58:02.854 --> 00:58:05.186
I would love to sing for you.

00:58:07.651 --> 00:58:08.766
Oh, just a minute...

00:58:09.861 --> 00:58:12.568
This is why I hate nobility.

00:58:13.448 --> 00:58:15.029
Hey, help me.

00:58:15.325 --> 00:58:17.190
Those guys won't leave me alone.

00:58:19.454 --> 00:58:20.454
Please!

00:58:21.248 --> 00:58:22.248
Hey!

00:58:29.256 --> 00:58:32.464
It's so much easier just
to swing around a sword.

00:58:33.176 --> 00:58:34.176
I agree.

00:58:34.845 --> 00:58:37.131
We shouldn't do things
we're not used to.

00:58:37.848 --> 00:58:40.715
I haven't worn a skirt in years.

00:58:42.394 --> 00:58:44.225
And I have all these muscles now.

00:58:46.857 --> 00:58:48.893
I look funny, don't I?

00:58:51.862 --> 00:58:52.862
Not at all.

00:58:54.322 --> 00:58:55.322
You look pretty good.

00:58:55.991 --> 00:58:56.991
Really?

00:59:00.704 --> 00:59:01.704
Yeah.

00:59:02.956 --> 00:59:05.823
Why don't you go and
ask Griffith for a dance?

00:59:08.211 --> 00:59:11.169
I'd only step on his toes.

00:59:14.885 --> 00:59:17.342
So what made you change?

00:59:18.263 --> 00:59:21.426
You never used to show up
at these stuffy functions.

00:59:25.729 --> 00:59:27.139
I thought I'd see it for myself...

00:59:28.148 --> 00:59:29.148
Huh?

00:59:30.317 --> 00:59:33.397
I wanted to see just what Griffith and
the band of the hawk have accomplished.

00:59:33.653 --> 00:59:35.644
All the things
he's managed to get so far...

00:59:37.074 --> 00:59:39.315
And everything he's going to try
to get from here on out.

00:59:41.787 --> 00:59:43.402
Guts, are you...?

00:59:46.124 --> 00:59:47.239
I've had enough...

00:59:48.251 --> 00:59:51.459
Of being part of his dream
and looking up at him.

01:00:00.180 --> 01:00:01.215
He's the only one...

01:00:02.891 --> 01:00:04.722
I can't allow to take me for granted.

01:00:06.937 --> 01:00:09.178
You're... not...

01:00:12.651 --> 01:00:13.651
Your excellency!

01:00:16.071 --> 01:00:17.071
Your excellency!

01:00:34.297 --> 01:00:40.543
Everyone, you have endured well
over these many months of tribulation.

01:00:40.971 --> 01:00:43.007
You have my sincerest thanks.

01:00:48.854 --> 01:00:52.346
As you are aware,
this victory was all due

01:00:52.357 --> 01:00:57.021
to the work of the band of the hawk
led by count Griffith.

01:00:57.946 --> 01:00:59.356
For nearly 100 years,

01:00:59.364 --> 01:01:03.027
the capture of doldrey had been
considered an impossible task.

01:01:03.243 --> 01:01:08.237
But with great daring and courage,
they accomplished it.

01:01:12.586 --> 01:01:18.001
Thus, I am bestowing the name,
the white Phoenix knights,

01:01:18.008 --> 01:01:20.875
to count Griffith and
his band of the hawk,

01:01:20.927 --> 01:01:24.419
the first time such a rank and
honor has been granted.

01:01:26.725 --> 01:01:28.716
The white Phoenix general!

01:01:28.894 --> 01:01:30.759
The white Phoenix knights!

01:01:31.062 --> 01:01:32.062
Oh my!

01:01:41.990 --> 01:01:42.990
Ridiculous...

01:01:43.074 --> 01:01:44.860
At this rate, they will...

01:01:44.910 --> 01:01:46.070
Ouch...

01:01:46.745 --> 01:01:48.656
I'm not dreaming, after all.

01:01:48.705 --> 01:01:53.039
We're nobles!

01:05:06.444 --> 01:05:08.856
Hurrah for the band of the hawk...!

01:05:16.913 --> 01:05:19.529
It's cold...

01:06:19.309 --> 01:06:25.396
Guts, we've argued many times,
but we've braved death together.

01:06:26.149 --> 01:06:28.829
All the hardship the band of the hawk
endured is finally paying off.

01:06:29.319 --> 01:06:32.607
This is only the beginning.
Why would you...?

01:06:33.239 --> 01:06:35.230
I've already made up my mind.

01:06:35.950 --> 01:06:36.950
But...!

01:06:39.704 --> 01:06:40.704
Guts!

01:06:49.005 --> 01:06:52.918
You intend on quitting
the band of the hawk?

01:06:56.221 --> 01:06:57.221
I'm sorry.

01:06:58.765 --> 01:07:00.346
That's not an explanation.

01:07:01.184 --> 01:07:04.426
The band of the hawk
is your family!

01:07:04.854 --> 01:07:07.311
What reason could you possibly
have to abandon us?

01:07:08.274 --> 01:07:10.390
We can be nobles!

01:07:10.735 --> 01:07:13.147
We'll be able to live a life
that's straight out of a dream.

01:07:13.196 --> 01:07:14.902
What misgivings could you have?!

01:07:15.365 --> 01:07:18.903
A grown man made the decision,
so let's respect it.

01:07:19.035 --> 01:07:21.071
But... but...!

01:07:21.829 --> 01:07:23.319
You're all against it, aren't you?!

01:07:24.123 --> 01:07:26.284
Guts is vital to
the band of the hawk!

01:07:27.502 --> 01:07:30.790
The band of the hawk isn't strong
just because of him!

01:07:31.047 --> 01:07:31.752
But...

01:07:31.839 --> 01:07:32.839
Shut the hell up!

01:07:40.640 --> 01:07:42.972
This is as good an occasion as any
to say this!

01:07:43.184 --> 01:07:46.768
I've hated you from the very start.

01:07:47.564 --> 01:07:51.227
And I finally figured out
why you irritate the hell outta me.

01:07:51.859 --> 01:07:53.099
It's that face of yours!

01:07:53.611 --> 01:07:55.147
Looking so smug...

01:07:55.196 --> 01:07:57.278
Like you're the only one
who's got serious troubles.

01:07:57.448 --> 01:08:00.281
You really make me sick!

01:08:02.537 --> 01:08:03.902
He's something else!

01:08:04.247 --> 01:08:09.412
All that we had to endure to
get here means nothing to him.

01:08:10.003 --> 01:08:12.460
So let him throw it all away
like yesterday's trash.

01:08:12.463 --> 01:08:15.500
Walk the path of suffering
as much as you want!

01:08:17.760 --> 01:08:22.003
I don't know what you're looking for,
but you'll never be Griffith.

01:08:22.515 --> 01:08:23.515
Never!

01:08:30.607 --> 01:08:34.646
If we ever meet up on the battlefield,
watch your back!

01:08:35.653 --> 01:08:37.644
Man, that felt good!

01:08:44.370 --> 01:08:45.951
Thanks for everything, guys.

01:08:48.833 --> 01:08:50.243
Wait, guts!

01:08:57.550 --> 01:09:01.384
I thought I told you that day...
That you belong to me.

01:09:07.060 --> 01:09:09.301
If you insist on leaving...

01:09:12.482 --> 01:09:14.518
Wrest yourself away
by your sword.

01:09:15.234 --> 01:09:16.234
Griffith...

01:09:19.447 --> 01:09:22.029
So I can't just leave with
3 smile and a "take care"?

01:09:25.662 --> 01:09:26.868
I guess you mean business.

01:09:29.540 --> 01:09:30.540
Wait!

01:09:30.667 --> 01:09:32.532
You're comrades!
Are you really going to fight?

01:09:33.419 --> 01:09:35.956
Griffith, if you want to stop him,
talk it through!

01:09:40.718 --> 01:09:42.709
Casca, don't get in our way.

01:09:44.639 --> 01:09:47.096
Pippin, what're you doing? Let go!

01:09:47.934 --> 01:09:49.094
There's no other way.

01:09:50.520 --> 01:09:53.387
Maybe if he gets an arm cut off,
he'll come to his senses.

01:09:54.440 --> 01:09:57.147
What's wrong with all of you?
Stop them!

01:09:57.568 --> 01:10:00.901
Did the good life in
a real army make you forget?

01:10:01.823 --> 01:10:04.423
If you're taken with a sword,
you take yourself back with a sword.

01:10:04.617 --> 01:10:07.233
That's the rule for mercenaries like us.

01:10:07.537 --> 01:10:08.537
But...!

01:10:12.875 --> 01:10:13.875
But...

01:10:19.549 --> 01:10:24.043
Stand against anyone who dares fo
trample on it with his body and soul.

01:10:24.679 --> 01:10:27.216
Even if that person is me.

01:10:47.744 --> 01:10:50.611
Are you so defermined...

01:10:51.831 --> 01:10:54.072
Fo leave my grasp?

01:11:01.966 --> 01:11:02.966
You can't ..

01:11:04.010 --> 01:11:05.010
You can't!

01:11:06.095 --> 01:11:07.095
[Won't allow rt!

01:11:53.059 --> 01:11:54.059
Griffith!

01:12:12.995 --> 01:12:13.995
Take care.

01:12:30.972 --> 01:12:31.972
Griffith...

01:12:38.855 --> 01:12:39.855
Guts!

01:12:43.484 --> 01:12:44.484
Guts...

01:13:17.351 --> 01:13:18.591
Absolutely not!

01:13:18.978 --> 01:13:22.516
A Princess of a kingdom going out
to meet a gentleman of common birth...?!

01:13:22.732 --> 01:13:25.223
Lord Griffith now is
the general of the white Phoenix!

01:13:25.526 --> 01:13:27.983
It is the highest rank
in the midland army!

01:13:28.237 --> 01:13:30.728
That is only after
next month's installation.

01:13:31.616 --> 01:13:35.200
Anna, do keep an eye on her.

01:13:35.995 --> 01:13:38.281
I haven't seen him in six months.

01:13:39.040 --> 01:13:40.040
At least...

01:14:02.772 --> 01:14:05.479
Just when we finally have peace...

01:14:11.739 --> 01:14:12.739
Who's there?!

01:14:21.958 --> 01:14:23.323
Lord Griffith...

01:14:33.052 --> 01:14:34.052
Pardon me...

01:14:43.646 --> 01:14:45.557
What is the matter?

01:14:46.399 --> 01:14:49.516
If anyone discovers you,
there will be such a terrible uproar!

01:14:50.194 --> 01:14:51.194
Forgive me...

01:14:51.988 --> 01:14:55.856
I suppose this breach of etiquette
is unforgivable.

01:14:56.492 --> 01:14:57.492
I'll leave...

01:15:02.248 --> 01:15:03.454
I've longed to see you.

01:15:04.583 --> 01:15:08.496
From the moment you left,
I've been so afraid...

01:15:09.714 --> 01:15:13.002
Every day, I dreaded getting word
about you from the battlefield...

01:15:13.342 --> 01:15:18.177
I prayed so hard for your well-being.

01:15:20.016 --> 01:15:24.134
God has answered my prayers.

01:15:28.524 --> 01:15:29.604
Forgive me...

01:15:30.192 --> 01:15:32.432
I'm so overcome with relief
that I can't help my tears...

01:16:09.565 --> 01:16:10.680
No!

01:16:11.817 --> 01:16:13.227
Are you afraid?

01:16:59.448 --> 01:17:03.532
Yes... there is nothing
to be afraid of.

01:17:05.913 --> 01:17:09.326
All the frightening things...
All the sad things...

01:17:10.292 --> 01:17:13.500
Just cast them into the fire.

01:17:16.257 --> 01:17:17.497
It's pouring.

01:17:19.009 --> 01:17:20.249
Have you seen Griffith?

01:17:20.886 --> 01:17:23.673
Nah, I haven't seen him since then.

01:17:24.557 --> 01:17:25.557
I see.

01:18:19.904 --> 01:18:20.904
Jake care...

01:20:29.825 --> 01:20:34.410
Well, well... if it isn't his lordship,
the future white Phoenix general.

01:20:35.456 --> 01:20:37.617
What brings you here
at this early hour?

01:20:38.667 --> 01:20:41.454
You do realize whose palace this is?

01:20:42.087 --> 01:20:43.793
There may even be cause
to charge you

01:20:43.839 --> 01:20:46.421
with treason against
the midland's royal house.

01:20:47.843 --> 01:20:49.379
Take him away!

01:21:03.400 --> 01:21:04.765
What's up with Griffith?

01:21:04.985 --> 01:21:07.146
Making us assemble like this.

01:21:07.279 --> 01:21:09.565
It's probably a surprise drill.

01:21:09.865 --> 01:21:11.730
But we were told not
to bring any weapons.

01:21:11.784 --> 01:21:13.866
It's probably just a jaunt.

01:21:14.370 --> 01:21:17.578
Since we beat chuder,
we haven't been in a decent battle.

01:21:17.915 --> 01:21:19.997
But of all days...

01:21:21.043 --> 01:21:23.409
He didn't return at all yesterday.

01:21:23.879 --> 01:21:26.586
It must've been
a shock to Griffith, after all.

01:21:26.924 --> 01:21:30.542
Stupid! Something like that
wouldn't bother Griffith.

01:21:30.844 --> 01:21:31.583
But...

01:21:31.595 --> 01:21:32.960
Just shut up!

01:21:33.305 --> 01:21:36.843
Who cares if we lose a fool like him?!

01:21:37.226 --> 01:21:39.512
Griffith is a hero
who rescued a nation!

01:21:39.978 --> 01:21:42.185
He has no time to bother
with one subordinate!

01:21:42.231 --> 01:21:42.936
That's ridiculous.

01:21:42.981 --> 01:21:43.766
But...

01:21:43.816 --> 01:21:46.398
"But... but!" Stop it!

01:21:46.527 --> 01:21:48.267
You just keep your mouth shut!

01:21:49.238 --> 01:21:51.479
Ever since that guy left,
everyone's been so depressed!

01:21:51.532 --> 01:21:52.567
I'm sick of it!

01:21:53.033 --> 01:21:55.115
Still, Griffith is late.

01:21:56.787 --> 01:22:02.532
We're being attacked!

01:22:17.558 --> 01:22:18.638
Is this an ambush?!

01:22:20.727 --> 01:22:21.727
Damn!

01:22:21.770 --> 01:22:22.976
Remnants from chuder?

01:22:23.105 --> 01:22:24.686
No, hold on...

01:22:25.441 --> 01:22:26.441
They're...!

01:22:33.574 --> 01:22:34.905
The midland army!

01:22:40.622 --> 01:22:41.657
I should have known.

01:22:42.374 --> 01:22:45.662
Common birth is something
you cannot change.

01:22:46.003 --> 01:22:50.542
After I favored you,
this is how you pay me back?!

01:22:51.467 --> 01:22:55.335
It's over for you and your comrades!
It's all over!

01:23:02.227 --> 01:23:06.186
I see. I thought it was strange.

01:23:07.483 --> 01:23:09.599
Political marriages are
common during wartime.

01:23:09.985 --> 01:23:14.069
But there was never talk about
Princess Charlotte getting married.

01:23:14.781 --> 01:23:16.487
What are you saying...?

01:23:19.703 --> 01:23:22.945
You wanted to have Charlotte
for yourself.

01:23:23.665 --> 01:23:24.665
No...

01:23:25.626 --> 01:23:27.833
You want her
to have you, isn't that right?

01:23:31.381 --> 01:23:32.587
Silence!

01:23:39.306 --> 01:23:42.719
Damn it, we can't die until we find out
what the hell is going on!

01:23:42.851 --> 01:23:45.137
Hey, what's happening?!

01:23:45.437 --> 01:23:47.553
Tell us... Griffith...!

01:23:50.526 --> 01:23:52.983
Don't stay together.
They're aiming for us.

01:23:53.195 --> 01:23:55.106
Wait, corkus!

01:23:55.614 --> 01:23:57.070
Don't scatter!

01:23:57.407 --> 01:23:59.568
There's no way
we'll break through them alone!

01:24:00.452 --> 01:24:03.569
Get into formation!
Don't give the enemy any chances!

01:24:03.705 --> 01:24:05.445
We'll attack together
and make a run for it!

01:24:05.916 --> 01:24:06.951
- Right!
- Gotcha!

01:24:08.085 --> 01:24:10.792
Everyone, get into wedge formation!

01:24:11.463 --> 01:24:12.578
Attack!

01:24:18.220 --> 01:24:19.220
Griffith!

01:24:28.855 --> 01:24:30.345
Torturer!

01:24:30.649 --> 01:24:31.649
Yes!

01:24:33.318 --> 01:24:35.684
Do whatever you wish to this man.

01:24:36.446 --> 01:24:39.529
He has sinned gravely
against midland's royal house.

01:24:39.866 --> 01:24:42.152
Y-you're certain?

01:24:42.744 --> 01:24:44.860
However, you must not kill him.

01:24:45.372 --> 01:24:51.288
He shall be made to see the gravity
of his crime while he still breathes.

01:24:51.420 --> 01:24:52.660
Yes!

01:24:53.255 --> 01:24:54.961
The hawk has fallen to earth.

01:24:55.424 --> 01:24:57.585
It will never take flight again.

01:25:41.887 --> 01:25:43.593
You are something else.

01:25:43.764 --> 01:25:47.552
You've been beaten to a pulp,
yet you haven't uttered a single cry.

01:25:47.684 --> 01:25:50.221
I-I'm really impressed.

01:25:50.812 --> 01:25:51.517
Huh?

01:25:51.813 --> 01:25:53.428
What's this?

01:25:53.857 --> 01:25:56.064
That's great! I want it.

01:26:04.201 --> 01:26:08.365
Ah, what a waste...
I dropped it.
